# Shape language

Penny Edge uses **fully rounded** interactive controls and **modest radius** on containers.

| Element | Token |
| --- | --- |
| Buttons, pill selects, status chips, tags, nav pills, toggle-like controls | `var(--radius-full)` |
| Cards, panels, tables, editor shells | `var(--radius-md)` |
| Small nested surfaces (code blocks, compact inputs inside panels) | `var(--radius-sm)` or `var(--radius-md)` |

## Do not

- Do not “de-AI” pill UIs by switching them to `--radius-sm`. Fully rounded pills are intentional brand language here.
- Prefer matching nearby existing components (`Button`, `.home-pill`, `.scanner-pill`) over inventing a new radius for the same control type.
